        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/6f149859385b756c33fc33ed7e3f71ce.avif?t=1764870312\" width=616 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squidly wasn’t a hero. He was just a squishy little reef-dweller with more heart than muscle. But when Lord Azure and his Abyssal Cult started dragging folks into the deep and wrecking his home, even a squid has his limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then Poseidon — ancient sea god, part-time drama queen — blessed him with divine power and one mission: get revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/f97724af9a979a2c028a292135f7d074.poster.avif?t=1764870312\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/f97724af9a979a2c028a292135f7d074.webm?t=1764870312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in this <strong>fast-paced underwater roguelike</strong>, Squidly fights back using whatever weapons his enemies drop — from mantis shrimp knuckle dusters to barnacle blasters. <strong>Every run is randomized</strong>, chaotic, and packed with cartoon mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.poster.avif?t=1764870312\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.webm?t=1764870312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.mp4?t=1764870312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive waves of enemies</strong>, <strong>steal their gear</strong>, and take on the ocean's deadliest bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He’s underqualified. He’s overpowered. He’s out for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Squidly’s Revenge</i> — a deep-sea brawl for the ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge powerful bosses, defeat them to steal their boss abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of enemies and bosses till the very end </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate run modifiers that ramp up difficulty - and the rewards. Mix and match to tailor the perfect run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn permanent upgrades between runs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same - randomized bosses and enemies to keep you on your toes (tentacles?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Endless Game Mode for infinite replayability. </p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/6f149859385b756c33fc33ed7e3f71ce.avif?t=1764870312\" width=616 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squidly wasn’t a hero. He was just a squishy little reef-dweller with more heart than muscle. But when Lord Azure and his Abyssal Cult started dragging folks into the deep and wrecking his home, even a squid has his limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then Poseidon — ancient sea god, part-time drama queen — blessed him with divine power and one mission: get revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/f97724af9a979a2c028a292135f7d074.poster.avif?t=1764870312\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/f97724af9a979a2c028a292135f7d074.webm?t=1764870312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in this <strong>fast-paced underwater roguelike</strong>, Squidly fights back using whatever weapons his enemies drop — from mantis shrimp knuckle dusters to barnacle blasters. <strong>Every run is randomized</strong>, chaotic, and packed with cartoon mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.poster.avif?t=1764870312\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.webm?t=1764870312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.mp4?t=1764870312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive waves of enemies</strong>, <strong>steal their gear</strong>, and take on the ocean's deadliest bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He’s underqualified. He’s overpowered. He’s out for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Squidly’s Revenge</i> — a deep-sea brawl for the ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge powerful bosses, defeat them to steal their boss abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of enemies and bosses till the very end </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate run modifiers that ramp up difficulty - and the rewards. Mix and match to tailor the perfect run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn permanent upgrades between runs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same - randomized bosses and enemies to keep you on your toes (tentacles?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Endless Game Mode for infinite replayability. </p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A fast-paced underwater roguelike where a squishy squid with divine powers steals enemy weapons to take revenge on Lord Azure and his Abyssal Cult. Chaos, crustaceans, and cartoon violence await!",
